# Tests

- Import `test` and `expect` from `@fixtures` only.
- Place specs in `tests/api`, `tests/ui`, or `tests/flows` by intent.
- Use `userFactory.create()` for seeded users; rely on fixture teardown for delete.
- For UI signup: `buildUser()` → after account created call `userFactory.track(user)`; untrack after explicit delete.
- API checks: `expect(body.responseCode).toBe(...)`.
- Assert sharp oracles (address fragment, product name continuity, brand on detail) — avoid vacuous expects.
- Depth over breadth — extend existing critical flows rather than spraying shallow smoke tests.
- Copy from `templates/*.template` when starting a new file.
